cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "kaoiro"
abstract: >-
  A system that visualizes the state and progress of multiple CLI AI
  agents (e.g. Claude Code, Codex) as characters, so operators running
  several agents at once can see at a glance who is working, who is
  waiting, and who needs attention.
authors:
